;<--- This is a comment in gromacs, everything after ; will be ignored

#include "oplsaa.ff/forcefield.itp" ; This top level file defines types of atoms we are allowed to call in our molecular topology / ff mixing rules / rules for 1-4 interactions
#include "methanol_oplsaa.itp" ; This .itp file can be generated by hand or using tools online, it calls the appropriate atoms types and defines the appropriate connectivity/masses/charges


[ system ] ; This introduces our system 
METHANOL

[ molecules ] ; This tells what molecules (pre-defined in the above includes) that will be in the system / how many
MeO	968

